{"additions":3809,"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NTk1OTI3","is_bot":false,"login":"ArthurZucker","name":"Arthur"},"baseRefName":"main","body":"<!-- ci-dashboard-badge:start -->\n[![🤗 Transformers CI](https://img.shields.io/badge/%F0%9F%A4%97%20Transformers%20CI-333333?style=flat)](https://transformers-ci.huggingface.cool/d/pytest-observability-by-pr/pytest-observability-branch?var-pr=49566)\n<!-- ci-dashboard-badge:end -->\n\nDecision (Jev-like) models: a chat template plus a head on the original checkpoint, whose repo holds only the head. Needs #47386.\n\n**Supported**\n- JEV: `autotrust/JEV-9B`, `JEV-27B`, `JEV-27B-VL`, `JEV-35B`, `JEV-Gemma4-26B-A4B`, `GEV-26B-Decide`\n- JEV (code readouts): `perplexity-ai/pplx-decider-v1.1-27b`, `pplx-decider-v1-27b`; `vllm-sr/d3`, `d3-flash`, `d3-mini`, `d3-nano`, `d3-edge`, `d3-lite`; `FINAL-Bench/Darwin-27B-ZTC` (`-v2`, `-v5`); `masterset-ai/PhysicalEye-Decide-35B`\n- KEV: `jaredpalmer/kev-4b`\n- VON: `wfzyx/von`\n- CLEF: `Cloudflare/clef-flash`\n\n**Core loading**\n- A sub-model without weights in the checkpoint loads from the repo of its config, and its PEFT adapter from the subfolder named after it. E.g. `ArthurZ/JEV-27B` is a head + `backbone/` LoRA on `autotrust/JEV-27B`; a ColQwen2 fine-tune can ship `embedding_proj_layer` + `vlm/` LoRA on Qwen2-VL.\n- Root conversions skip a base model of another type (the backbone of a head).\n- Qwen3.5: `use_bidirectional_attention`.\n\n<!-- mlinter-state-start -->\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 mlinter review state</summary>\n\n- hash: `14b3d66c`\n- commit: `022ad0c9`\n- review: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/pull/49566#pullrequestreview-5503143962\n\n</details>\n<!-- mlinter-state-end -->\n","changedFiles":71,"createdAt":"2026-10-13T11:30:24Z","deletions":411,"files":[{"path":"docs/source/en/_toctree.yml","additions":8,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/source/en/internal/generation_utils.md","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/sou